cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QUASAR: quantum algorithms for mutation-selection dynamics"
abstract: >-
  A quantum-algorithmic treatment of mutation-selection dynamics. Formalises the
  Crow-Kimura and Eigen generator as a target for quantum eigenvector extraction, compares
  a heuristic near-term imaginary-time route against a QSVT Perron-vector route, and maps
  the quantum-classical boundary against three classical baselines including the
  Dixit-Srivastava-Vishnoi polynomial-time algorithm. No quantum advantage is claimed.
type: software
